"Owner" means melimoyano.com, contact details are published on the website where you bought the Software. "Software" means everything delivered to you under the name Reels Sin Editor, in any form, including the starter package, the downloaded core package, every update, and each of the following: source code, compiled or obfuscated code, scripts, command files, slash commands, skills, instructions, prompts, playbooks and knowledge files (the "brain"), flows, rules, templates, styles and style files, effect libraries and their designs, animation and motion definitions, caption and layout logic, sound and font packs (subject to their own notices), schemas, data files, documentation, the way it is organised and structured, and its look and behaviour. "Licence Key" means the key issued to you for one purchase. "Output" means the videos and files you produce using the Software.

