The Software, and all copyright, trade secret, database, design, trademark and other intellectual property rights in it, belong to the Owner and its licensors. The Software contains confidential know-how and trade secrets. No right, title or interest is transferred to you except the limited licence in section 3. All rights not expressly granted are reserved. The names "Reels Sin Editor" and "Reels Without an Editor", and any logos, are trademarks of the Owner; no licence to use them is granted.

