(d) modify, translate, adapt, merge, or create derivative works of the Software, except for the Styles you create under section 6;
(e) reverse engineer, decompile, disassemble, deobfuscate, decrypt, unpack, debug, trace, or otherwise try to discover the source code, algorithms, keys, prompts, playbooks, designs or structure of the Software, or to read its protected files;
