(h) remove, alter or hide any copyright, trademark, licence or other proprietary notice, or any watermark or identifier;
(i) use the Software to provide a service to third parties as a software-as-a-service, bureau, platform or subscription, or to process videos at scale for third parties other than your own clients' videos produced by you;
(j) benchmark, publish technical information about, or disclose the Software's contents, prompts, rules, structure or protections;
(k) use the Software in breach of law or the rights of others, or to produce unlawful content.

